                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c4f4922-543d-3c69-adc8-297d0f5d18e3",
                                        "entry_id": "a71f7a4e-f0a9-32be-940a-f7da670c0043",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obsolete spelling of lie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ec383b5-a478-4f6d-b5e1-72439acc0889",
                                                "sense_id": "0c4f4922-543d-3c69-adc8-297d0f5d18e3",
                                                "text": "Now negligent of sports I lye,\nAnd now as other Fawkners use,\nI spring a mistresse, sweare, write, sigh and weepe:\nAnd the game kill'd, or lost, goe talk, and sleepe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf54e90c-fba3-4d11-a125-cec6719d87e7",
                                                "sense_id": "0c4f4922-543d-3c69-adc8-297d0f5d18e3",
                                                "text": "But when his foe lyes proſtrate on the plain,\nHe ſheaths his paws, uncurls his angry mane;\nAnd, pleas'd with bloudleſs honours of the day,\nWalks over, and diſdains th' inglorious Prey,[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
